			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740410101,
					"content": "布羅意，你說的那兩座觀測站的資料，我們已經拿到手啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740410102,
					"content": "真的嗎？！那還真是太好了！拜託了，快點讓我看看——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410103,
						740410104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "布羅意"
				},
				{
					"id": 740410103,
					"content": "喏，給你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740410107,
					"content": "將之前收集到的紙帶交給了布羅意…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740410108,
					"content": "啊啊啊！沒錯，就是這個，就是這個！兩位簡直就是上天派來救我脫離苦海，重新過上美好幸福清閒生活的天使——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "布羅意"
				},
				{
					"id": 740410109,
					"content": "也不至於誇張到這個地步吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740410110,
					"content": "#總之，事不宜遲，好心的{M#先生}{F#小姐}，我這就去找主管申請中樞處理站的鑰匙，請您稍微等我一下！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "布羅意"
				},
				{
					"id": 740410111,
					"content": "唉，真是的…記得快一點呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740410112,
					"content": "沒過多久，布羅意興奮地回來了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740410113,
					"content": "#{M#先生}{F#小姐}，我已經拿到鑰匙了！接下來只要前往中樞處理站，完成這些資料的整理，水文觀測事業就可以順利恢復了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410114,
						740410115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "布羅意"
				},
				{
					"id": 740410114,
					"content": "哦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740410116,
					"content": "考慮到「果果軟糖站」和「桔桔薄餅站」的情況，中樞處理站說不定也有那些來自至冬的先生們…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "布羅意"
				},
				{
					"id": 740410117,
					"content": "所以…拜託了，請兩位陪伴我一起去吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "布羅意"
				},
				{
					"id": 740410118,
					"content": "唔，你不要忘了給我們報酬呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740410115,
					"content": "這種事情也需要我們跟著去嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740410104,
					"content": "我們的報酬呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740410105,
					"content": "這個…請您不必擔心，只要主管能批准恢復原本的水文研究，報酬一定不會少了您的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "布羅意"
				},
				{
					"id": 740410106,
					"content": "嘿嘿，那就好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740410107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
